    "chunk_text": "anre stefne \u00feus \u00dea \u00fee hie \u00feohtan \u00fe\u00e6t scip on o\u00fere healfe to w\u00e6ndenne se scipes steora him to cw\u00e6\u00fe: Eala ge Ic sealde eow mihta ofer n\u00e6dran to tredanne, & ofer ealle feondes mihta, & he hym eft to cw\u00e6\u00fe: Ac fara\u00fe & nelle gebugan ne on \u00fea swy\u00feran healfe ne on \u00fea wynstran, ac rihtlice & & \u00fea \u00fee hie up of scipe eoden \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00fe hym to se scipes w\u00e6s drihten self. Syn ge min gemynd wel sy & ic beo eower. Sona swa seo n\u00e6ddre para monna sweg geherde heo swy\u00fee grymme ongean hie ferde, & heore \u00dea w\u00e6s mycel betwuh \u00fea \u00fee on \u00feon iglande wunodon mo. \u00dea se halga Machu hine geinseglade mid insegle \u00fe\u00e6re halgan rode & \u00e6tforan his leorningcnihtum \u00dea wunderlicum gemetum se draca byfigende to s\u00e6 ferde, & \u00fea \u00fee he ferde eall \u00fe\u00e6t st\u00e6\u00fe onbutan Se halga Machu w\u00e6s \u00fea ingangende on \u00fe\u00e6s dracan scr\u00e6fe, & his st\u00e6fes pic on \u00feon scr\u00e6fe O\u00fe \u00feysne &weardan d\u00e6g of \u00fe\u00e6re stowe se beorhteste welspring flowe\u00fe, & \u00fea hie \u00fe\u00e6s scipes De susceptione eius Ealle \u00fea \u00fee on \u00feon iglande wunodon to \u00feon st\u00e6\u00fee urnon, & hine mid \u00deonon he w\u00e6s ferende to \u00fe\u00e6re ceastre \u00fee ale\u00fe is geciged, seo is up on \u00fe\u00e6re ea st\u00e6\u00fee \u00fee renc hatte Ac begemendum & gefultmiendum \u00fe\u00e6re godc",
